{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321520001:0":{"text":"오, 시더 마을에 오신 여행자시죠? 부적 필요하지 않으세요? 저희 집 가보인데, 돈이 필요해서 급하게 팔고 있어요!","source_cn":"哎呀，你们是来雪松镇旅游的游客吧？需不需要护身符？这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BC40FF4BC556D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321520002:0":{"text":"와... 이렇게나 많이! 아무래도 당신이... 아, 그러니까, 당신 집은 부적이 많은 모양이네요.","source_cn":"哇……这么多！看起来你找——呃，你家家传了不少护身符呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x051D651ADE7CE633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321520003:0":{"text":"조상 중에 부적을 만들던 분이 계셨다고 해요. 그래서 이렇게 많이 남은 거죠.","source_cn":"唉，听说俺家祖上有人是做这个的，这才留了不少下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC5EFEF2E60E4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321520004:0":{"text":"거기 안경 낀 청년, 당신... 음, 왜 이렇게 낯이 익을까요?","source_cn":"那位戴眼镜的小哥，你——哎，俺怎么看你这么眼熟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A2156E9AB50AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321520005:0":{"text":"아, 그게... 맞아요... 전에 시더 마을에 왔을 때 저에게 팔찌를 파신 적이 있어요.","source_cn":"哦……是、是眼熟……之前你在雪松镇上的时候，卖给过我一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA01D59D95CF43E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321520006:0":{"text":"아, 기억났어요. 다른 여자분과 같이 계셨죠? 어라, 그분은 어디 갔나요?","source_cn":"噢，俺想起来了，那天你和另一个小姑娘在一起。哎，怎么不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97F3DBB1E0055D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321520007:0":{"text":"어... 멜리사는... 그게... 에취!","source_cn":"呃……梅丽莎她……这个……阿嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0941855491B943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1321520007":{"text":"어... 멜리사는... 그게... 에취!","source_cn":"呃……梅丽莎她……这个……阿嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0941855491B943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321520008:0":{"text":"맞아요...! 꽃바다 들판에서 오래된 무덤을 발견했는데, 진짜인지 보러 가자고 하더라고요.","source_cn":"没错……！她说她在繁花原野发现了一个古代墓穴，让我们过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD57BD48EF01E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321520010:0":{"text":"아... 맞아요! 저, 전부 다 당신이 판 그 팔찌 덕분이에요.","source_cn":"啊……对！这、这还是多亏了你卖给我们的那个手环。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C744ADE7E992A34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_t